        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vilayat Khan, Ravi Shankar, Ali Akbar Khan, Nikhil Banerjee, Imrat Khan, Baba Allauddin Khan, Enayat Khan\n- Topics: Indian Classical Music, sitar\n\nFacts:\n- Enayat Khan was the father of Vilayat Khan.\n- Vilayat Khan was regarded as one of the top sitar players of the postwar period.\n- Nikhil Banerjee was a student of Baba Allauddin Khan.\n- Nikhil Banerjee was known for technical virtuosity and clinical execution.\n- Vilayat Khan, Ravi Shankar, Ali Akbar Khan, Nikhil Banerjee, and Imrat Khan helped introduce Indian Classical Music to the West.",
